    <guid isPermaLink="false">67564a41e2ff7919e8b93a47</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 01:15:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年随着吹牛老爹（P. Diddy）的多年不轨行径被大量披露，有关娱乐圈和阴谋势力之间的纠葛再一度成为了许多网友的谈资，但这其中有多少是合理的假设，又有多少只是耸人听闻的小报故事呢？这回，我们也借着这个机会勾勒一下美国嘻哈音乐的发展史，看看这种来自底层的声音是如何成为了流行音乐界的顶梁柱，而在这个发展过程中，是否真的有阴影中的势力在主导着一切，他们是否也对2Pac之死负有责任。</span></p><br><p><span>本期中使用音乐（按播放顺序）：</span></p><p><span>The Roots - Act Too (Love of My Life) (1999)</span></p><p><span>Grandmaster Flash &amp; The Furious Five - Superappin' (1979)</span></p><p><span>Amiri Baraka - Who Will Survive (1972)</span></p><p><span>Sugarhill Gang - Apache (1981)</span></p><p><span>Nas - Life's a Bitch (1994)</span></p><p><span>Ice-T - O.G. Original Gangster (1991)</span></p><p><span>2Pac - California Love (1996)</span></p><p><span>Capone-n-Noreaga - L.A., L.A. (Kuwait Mix) (1997)</span></p><p><span>A Tribe Called Quest - Show Business (1991)</span></p><p><span>Non Phixion - Drug Music (2002)</span></p><p><span>Jay-Z - The Story of O.J. (2017)</span></p><p><span>DJ Shadow - Mutual Slump (1996)</span></p><p><span>2Pac - Krazy (1996)</span></p><br><br>]]></description>
